        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before time was counted and stars had names, gods descended from the heavens... not to worshipped, but to rule.&quot; In the shadows of forgotten galaxies and beneath the sands of Sumeria, the Anunnaki cosmic architects and celestial miners left their mark on Earth and beyond. They were not myth. They were visitors. Technologists. Tyrants. Teachers. You are the last awakened clone of an ancient Anunnaki overlord, reactivated from stasis to restart the divine harvest. Enjoy Anunaki Clicker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clicks on the Black Hole give you Black Hole Points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Black Hole Points&quot; on different planets to unlock different maps(planets).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal the Aliens Easter Egg and unlock the &quot;UFO Abduction&quot; Steam achievement!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Anunnaki Niburu Planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a Steam marketable item every 1 hour!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before time was counted and stars had names, gods descended from the heavens... not to worshipped, but to rule.&quot; In the shadows of forgotten galaxies and beneath the sands of Sumeria, the Anunnaki cosmic architects and celestial miners left their mark on Earth and beyond. They were not myth. They were visitors. Technologists. Tyrants. Teachers. You are the last awakened clone of an ancient Anunnaki overlord, reactivated from stasis to restart the divine harvest. Enjoy Anunaki Clicker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clicks on the Black Hole give you Black Hole Points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Black Hole Points&quot; on different planets to unlock different maps(planets).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal the Aliens Easter Egg and unlock the &quot;UFO Abduction&quot; Steam achievement!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Anunnaki Niburu Planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a Steam marketable item every 1 hour!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Anunaki Clicker is a clicker cosmic idle game inspired by ancient Sumerian mythology in which you click a Black Hole and earn &quot;Black Hole Clicks&quot; points that you can spent to unlock maps which is planets or mini games on the game. Every 1 hour, you get dropped an marketable item of the game. Enjoy!",
